From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:18:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: deterministic JSON mirror of each canvas document

After every save the host PUTs docs/<doc>.fig.json: an id-free, default-free,
sorted-key rendering of the document (nodes by name path, variables as
$Collection/name, modes by name, numbers rounded to 1e-4) so versions and
git can diff a canvas. Read-only: nothing loads it.
